ut.\nHost RX is GPIO4 via powered-off buffer; default firmware leaves it disabled. UART0 adapter VREF powers only its outgoing buffer." (at 20.32 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b88073c5-6c1f-5a49-864a-e40c850c5d9b")) (text "All footprints unassigned: no board layout or manufacture claim. USB switch D pins face connector; 1D pins face ESP; port2NC andSground.\nTwo independent5.1k CC resistors. SBU pins NC. NoPD/high-voltage mode. Local USB shield bond toLOGIC_GND is provisional; assess enclosure/EMC.\nJRESET/JBOOT: normally-open dry contacts only. HoldBOOT low, holdRESET>=20ms, releaseRESET, keepBOOTlow>=3ms thenrelease.\nJRES is reserved internal3.3V logic only; current firmware provides no accessory support. No5V/24V/unpowered external drive.\nModule antenna outsidecarrieredge preferred; enclosureclearance>=15mm all directions. Shared2.4GHzWi-Fi/BLE, no5GHzorClassicBT." (at 20.32 565 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ba2dbc3d-68ec-5d97-99ea-40c44347cbb7")))
